[6.243, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.432, "o", "Proposal for Minecraft 1.20.1 forge (tier mid): 15 families, 73 mods.txt lines\r\n\r\n+ Thermal Series [thermal]: wants tech\r\n    ores and alloys, machines and dynamos, ducts, farming machines, Fluxbore and jetpack\r\n+ Quality of life [qol]: default for every pack\r\n    recipe viewer, ore and drop tables, block info on screen, in-game manuals, backpacks, food tooltips, drag over slots, a trash block\r\n+ Performance [perf]: default for every pack\r\n    render and memory fixes with no gameplay change; Embeddium + Oculus instead of OptiFine (OptiFine breaks Forge mods and is not on Modrinth)\r\n+ Mekanism [mekanism]: wants tech\r\n    ore tripling, chemistry, Digital Miner, MekaSuit\r\n+ Applied Energistics 2 [ae2]: wants tech\r\n    digital storage, terminals, autocrafting\r\n+ DivineRPG [divinerpg]: asked for by id; wants rpg\r\n    eight dimensions, bosses, gear tiers; a whole second line of progression\r\n    ! grindy by default: 4 boss fragments = 1 soul instead of 8 (pack config)\r\n+ FTB coop and quests [coop]: wants coop\r\n    q"]
[6.432, "o", "uest book, shared team progress, claimed chunks that keep running, voice chat, free waystones, no item loss on death\r\n+ Logistics [logistics]: wants tech\r\n    one pipe for everything, drawers, bigger chests, wireless energy\r\n+ The Twilight Forest [twilight]: wants rpg\r\n    one dimension with a chain of bosses and dungeons\r\n+ Farmer's Delight [food]: wants farming, food\r\n    cutting board, cooking pot, skillet, stove, four crops, meals with Nourishment\r\n+ QuarryPlus [quarry]: wants tech\r\n    the BuildCraft quarry: markers, Quarry Plus, Chunk Destroyer; removes the mining grind\r\n+ Forestry and bees [bees]: wants farming\r\n    multiblock farms, classic bee breeding, resource bees that feed the tech line\r\n+ World generation [worldgen]: wants worldgen\r\n    more biomes, deeper terrain, better vanilla structures; data only, no render cost\r\n+ Extreme Reactors [reactors]: wants tech\r\n    BigReactors: multiblock reactors and turbines on yellorium\r\n+ RFTools [rftools]: wants tech\r\n    the Builder with shape cards: digs, "]
[6.432, "o", "moves, copies structures\r\n\r\nskipped:\r\n"]
[6.432, "o", "  - create: heavy for a mid-tier machine\r\n"]
[6.732, "o", ""]
